@archive
  id: trap-defn-throw-rerun
  type: archive
  resolved: 2026-10-13
  former_type: trap
  claimed: v11에서 defn 내부 throw 시 함수가 재실행된다 (FX에도 해당?)
  observed_old: v11-interpreter-only PARTIAL; cgc UNVERIFIED
  observed_now: FX native try/catch → caught=first, calls=1 (재실행 없음)
  resolution: FX archive — throw propagates once. v11/AFJ retry 조사는 해당 계열에서. Regression locks calls=1.
  regression: tests/traps/trap-defn-throw-rerun.fl
  regression_command: bash tests/traps/run-trap-defn-throw-rerun.sh
  verification_status: resolved
  lint_detectable: false
  scope: fx-native (v11 claim left to AFJ/v11 docs)

@archive
  id: trap-mariadb-count-float
  type: archive
  resolved: 2026-10-13
  former_type: trap
  claimed: COUNT(*) 반환은 정수다 / float 일 수 있다
  observed_old: MariaDB COUNT float → (= $cnt 0) 실패 (claimed)
  observed_now: FX runtime/mariadb.c fetch_rows always fl_str_val (all non-null cells are strings). (= "0" 0)=false; (= "0" "0")=true. Not float — string.
  resolution: Document string-cell contract + safe_pattern (= (str $cnt) "0"). Typed coerce deferred (opaque MYSQL_FIELD / no libmariadb-dev).
  safe_pattern: (if (or (nil? $cnt) (= (str $cnt) "0")) ...)
  regression: tests/traps/trap-mariadb-count-string.fl
  regression_command: bash tests/traps/run-trap-mariadb-count-string.sh
  verification_status: resolved
  lint_detectable: false
  note: live DB probe optional; C contract + eq semantics locked without MARIADB_HOST

@archive
  id: trap-http-get-cgc-mapping
  type: archive
  resolved: 2026-10-12
  former_type: trap
  claimed: (http_get url) 는 cgc 에서 {status body headers} 맵을 반환한다
  observed_old: cgc mapped to fl_http_get (http.c) body string only; (get result "status") → nil
  observed_now: emits http_get(…) from http_client.c; map status/body/headers; kebab http-get same
  resolution: http_client map API already wired (cgc http-get→http_get; underscore default call). Legacy fl_http_get remains unused by this path. Regression locks emit+shape.
  regression: tests/traps/trap-http-get-cgc-mapping.fl
  regression_command: bash tests/traps/run-trap-http-get-cgc-mapping.sh
  verification_status: resolved
  lint_detectable: false
  note: apps that still (nil? resp) after http_get (e.g. fx-server-monitor) should check status; failure is status=0 map, not nil

@archive
  id: trap-nth-out-of-bounds
  type: archive
  resolved: 2026-10-12
  former_type: trap
  claimed: nth 로 범위 밖 인덱스 접근 시 오류가 발생한다
  observed_old: nil 반환 (에러 없음). catch 로 경계 검사하면 항상 통과
  observed_now: OOB (hi / neg / empty) → nil, exit 0; no crash/garbage
  resolution: FX 관례로 nil 유지 (Result 강제는 AFJ 먼저). fl_vec_get 계약 주석 + 회귀 잠금
  regression: tests/traps/trap-nth-out-of-bounds.fl
  regression_command: bash tests/traps/run-trap-nth-out-of-bounds.sh
  verification_status: resolved
  lint_detectable: false

@archive
  id: trap-atom-deref-gc
  type: archive
  resolved: 2026-10-12
  former_type: trap
  claimed: (reset! ch new-val) 후에도 deref 전에 캡처한 let 바인딩으로 atom 내용을 안전하게 읽을 수 있다
  observed_old: fl_atom_deref returned raw slot pointer; fl_atom_reset heap_release(old) left dangling locals → nil/segfault
  observed_now: fl_atom_deref / fl_atom_reset return fl_heap_copy of slot; hold-across-reset fixture prints hello / 1
  resolution: runtime/math.c — heap_copy on deref and on reset return (temps unreclaimed in C ABI; accepted for correctness)
  regression: tests/traps/trap-atom-deref-gc.fl
  regression_command: bash tests/traps/run-trap-atom-deref-gc.sh
  verification_status: resolved
  lint_detectable: false
  scope: cgc-only

@archive
  id: trap-lambda-capture
  type: archive
  resolved: 2026-10-12
  former_type: trap
  claimed: defn 파라미터를 람다 본문·중첩 defn에서 그대로 참조할 수 있다
  observed_old: 중첩 defn 호출이 inner(\x02, …) 등으로 깨지거나 바깥 파라미터가 미등록
  observed_now: nested free-vars → extra C params; /*CAP:name:…*/ in hoisted-fwds; fresh name copies before atom ops
  resolution: cgc-defn env-stack + CAP marker call prepend; cgc-copy-names before atom mutation
  regression: tests/traps/trap-lambda-capture.fl
  regression_command: bash tests/traps/run-trap-lambda-capture.sh
  verification_status: resolved
  lint_detectable: false

